 "short_name": "CoT",
 "_doc": "City of Tshwane (flattened PDF). Handles BOTH CoT layouts: (a) the metered English/Afrikaans summary bill, and (b) the Afrikaans TOU prepaid bill (Elektrisiteit Vooruitbetaal / Spits=Peak, Niespits=Off-Peak, Standard, Vaste=Fixed, Aanvraag=Demand). All patterns are DATE-AGNOSTIC. Amounts use spaces as thousands separators. XFA 'Adobe Reader' shells cannot be read - flatten in Adobe Reader first.\n\nFINGERPRINT (2026-08-28, hijack fix - extraction rules unchanged). Matching is plain case-insensitive SUBSTRING containment, so the old any-list entry \"Elektrisiteit\" (merely Afrikaans for electricity, printed by 15 of 219 unrelated bills in the Telkom pack) let City of Matlosana (Klerksdorp) bills route here: their Setswana small print reads \"O tshwanetse go duela disuga tsa gago tsa kgwedi...\", and \"tshwanetse\" CONTAINS the all-marker TSHWANE, while their Afrikaans column heading \"WATER / ELEKTRISITEITVERBRUIK\" satisfied the any-list. Rustenburg bills carry the identical Setswana line and were one Afrikaans heading away from the same hijack.\nThe any-list is now the sole discriminator and every entry is unique to Tshwane: \"CITY OF TSHWANE\" and \"STAD TSHWANE\" (the English/Afrikaans corporate names), \"4000142267\" (the CoT VAT registration number, printed on the payment stub as \"CITY OF TSHWANE VAT REG NO 4000142267\" - survives OCR wording damage, cf. mbombela), \"GISKEY\" (the Tshwane billing-system GIS-key field on the stand-info block; language-neutral, present on the real CoT fixture, absent from all 219 other bills in the pack), plus the municipal slogan and portal domain. \"MATLOSANA\" is added to reject_if_text as defence in depth - no CoT document names another municipality, so this covers every Matlosana layout and language variant. \"Prepayment Account Update\" must stay: it hands the Tshwane prepayment letters to cot_smart, which sorts AFTER cot. \"requires Adobe Reader 8 or higher\" must stay: it keeps unrendered Tshwane XFA e-billing shells in Unrecognized instead of producing an empty row. | CBX 1.0.77 (tested on the Telkom folder): the prepaid TOU registers print as E_PK_PP / E_OP_PP / E_STD_PP and the 'Elektrisiteit Vooruitbetaal' line prints no amounts — kWh now read for those codes and, when the category line has no total, the ex-VAT total is the sum of its charge lines (checked against the bill's own 'Total Current Levy (B)').",
